================================================================
Third-party components
================================================================

The following components are incorporated into Haipai. Their original
license notices are preserved alongside the ported code (or in the
submodule directory) as required.

- lib/defense_kd.py
    Ported from killer_mortal_gui,
    Copyright (C) 2025 Andy Olsen, licensed under the MIT License. The
    original MIT copyright and permission notice is preserved at the top of
    lib/defense_kd.py. Submodule fork tracked at
    https://github.com/goreil/killer_mortal_gui.

- lib/shanten.py
    Uses the `mahjong` PyPI package
    (https://github.com/MahjongRepository/mahjong), licensed under MIT.

- static/js/prep/partition.js
    Hand-partition algorithm ported from MahjongKit.py
    (Partition.partition / Partition._partition_single_type), part of
    JapaneseRiichiMahjongKit by Jianyang Tang (Thomas)
    <jian4yang2.tang1@gmail.com>. The upstream ships no LICENSE file; the
    port is included here for attributed credit to the original author.
    Source vendored as the MahjongKit/ submodule; fork tracked at
    https://github.com/goreil/MahjongKit.

- riichi-mahjong-tiles/ (git submodule)
    SVG tile graphics by FluffyStuff
    (https://github.com/FluffyStuff/riichi-mahjong-tiles), released into
    the public domain under CC0.

- killer_mortal_gui/ (git submodule)
    Full source of killer_mortal_gui, MIT. See killer_mortal_gui/LICENSE.

- riichi-tools-rs/ (git submodule) + wasm/haipai-shanten/
    The WASM shanten/ukeire kernel (static/wasm/haipai_shanten_bg.wasm) is
    compiled from riichi-tools-rs,
    Copyright (c) 2020 Matej Labaš (https://github.com/harphield/riichi-tools-rs),
    licensed under the MIT License. The kernel source is unmodified; Haipai's
    wasm-bindgen wrapper lives in wasm/haipai-shanten/. The MIT notice is
    preserved alongside the shipped binary at
    static/wasm/LICENSE-riichi-tools-rs.txt. Submodule fork tracked at
    https://github.com/goreil/riichi-tools-rs.

================================================================
Mahjong AI
================================================================

Analysis JSONs consumed by Haipai are produced by Mortal
(https://mjai.ekyu.moe). Mortal itself is not bundled with or executed
by Haipai; only its output is read. No Mortal code is redistributed here.
